</figure>
<div id="A6.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A6.T19" title="Table 19 ‣ F.3 VAE and forecasting result break down ‣ Appendix F Additional ablation studies ‣ Towards foundational LiDAR world models with efficient latent flow matching" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>, we present the compression performance of the proposed VAE across different semantic categories. With a 3× compression ratio, our method consistently outperforms prior approaches in all categories. Notably, for rare classes such as Construction Vehicle, Trailer, and Vegetation, our model achieves improvements of 22.2%, 18.8%, and 25.4% over DOME’s VAE, respectively. These results indicate that our VAE effectively mitigates the impact of data imbalance across categories in the compression process.</p>
</div>
